# Ajani Unrelenting: "Whenever you activate a loyalty ability, create a 2/2 colorless Wizard Soldier creature token named Cadet."
# Comet, Stellar Pup's 0 rolls a 6 ([Dice]): [+1], and "you may activate Comet's loyalty ability two more times this turn". Being
# allowed to activate is no activation (CR 602.2): the allowance the engine notes in the history triggers nothing, so only Comet's
# two real activations make Cadets - one each, two in all, where four would mean the allowance had triggered too. The first
# activation's trigger is above the 0 on the stack (CR 603.3), and so resolves first. The second roll, a 1, is [+2] and two
# Squirrels. Comet's loyalty: 5 + 1 + 2 = 8.

